{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Donut Shop Simulator,</strong> you will experience far more than just working as a cashier you will witness every nuance of running your own shop. While taking orders, instantly grasp your customers\u2019 needs and skillfully manage your finances during cash or credit card transactions. From organizing the product shelves and identifying shortages to ensuring that deliveries are timely and flawless, you\u2019ll make strategic decisions at every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the right product combinations and optimize your profit margins to process orders in the most profitable way. Increase customer satisfaction by promptly responding to their requests, and transform your small shop into the region\u2019s most popular dessert destination. The game\u2019s deep simulation not only offers you the opportunity to hone your management skills but also challenges your ability to think quickly, plan, and strategize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the freedom to customize every detail from your shop\u2019s signboard to its interior and even the delivery truck. Use the colors, styles, and texts of your choice to make your shop unique. Every detail is meticulously designed to reflect your shop\u2019s story and spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for an entertaining, immersive, and educational simulation experience that will make you the boss of your very own business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make your own donut</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654590/extras/newgif.gif?t=1748965125\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hire Cashier</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654590/extras/newgif2.gif?t=1748965125\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your shop as you wish.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654590/extras/shop.gif?t=1748965125\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your delivery truck.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654590/extras/turkc-02.gif?t=1748965125\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Order the products, place them on the shelves, and purchase them!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654590/extras/product.gif?t=1748965125\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3654590?t=1748965125","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3654590?t=1748965125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654590/47a653a122270471766ace8d08f1824ef481ffb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748965125","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654590/47a653a122270471766ace8d08f1824ef481ffb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748965125","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3747570,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Donut Shop Simulator,</strong> you will experience far more than just working as a cashier you will witness every nuance of running your own shop. While taking orders, instantly grasp your customers\u2019 needs and skillfully manage your finances during cash or credit card transactions. From organizing the product shelves and identifying shortages to ensuring that deliveries are timely and flawless, you\u2019ll make strategic decisions at every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the right product combinations and optimize your profit margins to process orders in the most profitable way. Increase customer satisfaction by promptly responding to their requests, and transform your small shop into the region\u2019s most popular dessert destination. The game\u2019s deep simulation not only offers you the opportunity to hone your management skills but also challenges your ability to think quickly, plan, and strategize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the freedom to customize every detail from your shop\u2019s signboard to its interior and even the delivery truck. Use the colors, styles, and texts of your choice to make your shop unique. Every detail is meticulously designed to reflect your shop\u2019s story and spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for an entertaining, immersive, and educational simulation experience that will make you the boss of your very own business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make your own donut</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654590/extras/newgif.gif?t=1748965125\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hire Cashier</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654590/extras/newgif2.gif?t=1748965125\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><stro